*   **Student Loan Interest ($2,700):** The IRS caps this "above-the-line" deduction at $2,500. However, for 2023, the deduction phases out completely for a Head of Household if your Modified Adjusted Gross Income (MAGI) is $90,000 or more. With your W-2, net consulting income, and interest, your MAGI will likely be over $90,000, meaning you will likely **not** be able to claim this deduction.
