*   **Schedule C (Profit or Loss from Business):** To report your $15,000 consulting income from your 4 clients.
*   **Form 8829 (Expenses for Business Use of Your Home):** To calculate and claim your ~$5,113+ actual expenses home office deduction against your Schedule C income.
*   **Schedule SE (Self-Employment Tax):** To calculate the Medicare and Social Security taxes owed on your net consulting profit (which will be your $15,000 minus your home office deduction).

